==English==

===Etymology===
[[drive|Drive]] is based on it being a [[memory drive]] that uses [[flash memory]].

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[flash]] [[drive]]}}

# {{lb|en|computer hardware}} A small [[electronic]] device used to store [[digital]] [[data]], more [[portable]] and [[robust]] than a [[hard drive]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|USB}} flash drive
* {{l|en|USB key}}
* {{l|en|jump drive}}
* {{l|en|thumb drive}}
* {{l|en|pen drive}}

